WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Zero kara kakedashite

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Start running from
the beginning,

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
Omoi dake
wo dakishimete

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
with nothing but your emotions
in your hands.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Sonomama kakenukete

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Just keep running...

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
Itsumo koko
de mitsumeteru

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
I'm always watching
you from here.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
Hajimete deatta hi no
manazashi wasurenai

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
I still remember your expression
the day we first met.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
Taiyou mitai ni kokoro
wo terashitekureta

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
It lit up my heart like the sun.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
Asu no yukue sagashite
nayandeiru nara

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
If you're anxious about
where to go tomorrow,

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
Ima kimi no tame
ni akari ni naritai yo

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
I want to become
a beacon to you.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Zero kara tobidatte

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Start flying from
the beginning.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Ima no kimi
wo toki hanachi

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Let go of your current self...

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
Mugen ni habataite

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
and fly towards infinity.

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
Donna toki
mo mimaru yo

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
I will always watch over you...

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
Kitto zutto tooku made

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
no matter how far you fly.

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:51.000
Episode 50 - The Mask
of the Goddess

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:08.970
Maya, I'm coming!

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:18.990
Ayumi...

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:20.550
Give me your hand!

00:02:38.150 --> 00:02:41.290
Thank you, Ayumi!

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:45.150
I'd better go tell everyone
this bridge is dangerous!

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:47.470
Thank you so much, Ayumi!

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:51.020
Maya...

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:55.760
What did I just try
to do to her?

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:01.760
I let her walk to her death!

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:05.010
I can't believe I'd do something
so cowardly,

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:10.090
when I've never even thought that
I wanted to get the role.

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:18.760
If she'd never shown up, I could have
lived with my head held high.

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:24.090
But now, this'd be even more
pathetic than losing to her.

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.180
I can't go back to Tokyo.

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:37.220
What was I doing yesterday?

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:45.000
It was such a strange
sensation.

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:49.470
It feels like some part of my
soul understands the role,

00:03:50.170 --> 00:03:53.180
but I still don't know how I should
act out the Scarlet Angel.

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:09.010
Ayumi?

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:18.310
Ayumi?

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:27.800
What are you doing here?

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:33.480
You came here to watch your inadequate
rival starting her rehearsals...

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:36.080
at this hour of the morning and who keeps going even
when covered in mud, didn't you?

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:37.270
What? No...

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:39.390
When it comes to acting,

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:42.970
I've never managed
to upstage you.

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:46.840
What are you saying?
I don't understand.

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:53.200
You wouldn't. You never
even realized it yourself.

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:57.760
You've made me taste bitter
defeat for too long now.

00:04:58.490 --> 00:05:03.390
The first time I had the feeling
of truly living a role...

00:05:03.390 --> 00:05:05.390
was when we acted together.

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:10.360
But then, you told me that it always
feels like that for you.

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:18.650
I work so hard to capture each role, but
you grasp their essence instinctively!

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:23.060
Just the sight of you makes me think
that all my efforts are in vain!

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:25.640
I have no faith in myself!

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:27.440
What do you mean?

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:28.890
You're a genius!

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:30.110
Don't call me that!

00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:32.160
I'm no genius.

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:35.310
<i>You're</i> the genius!

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:39.720
Ayumi, what are you saying?

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:42.030
Are you making fun of me?

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:45.330
You're bursting with so much talent,
yet you don't even realize it.

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:49.130
That's what I really
hate about you!

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:54.290
I can't believe you can possibly think
that when you're way more talented...

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:56.350
and much more beautiful
than anyone else!

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:59.640
That's only because I
thought that, one day,

00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:02.200
I would defeat you and play the Scarlet Angel.

00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:06.880
I never let anything get me down, because
once you let defeat get to you,

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:08.630
you can never stand
back up again.

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:14.550
But when I saw you acting in the Valley of
the Plums, I realized there are things...

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:17.690
I'll never be able to achieve, no matter
how much effort I expend.

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:22.680
It made me feel like my whole life
up till now has been a waste.

00:06:23.060 --> 00:06:26.350
Like my entire being was
being invalidated.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:32.940
I planned to return to Tokyo and
give up on the Scarlet Angel.

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:36.870
And for the first time,
I hated you.

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:40.660
I thought that, if only you
were gone, then I'd...

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:41.670
What?

00:06:42.140 --> 00:06:47.750
I knew the suspension
bridge was rotten.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:53.030
I was going to let you die.

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:58.140
But Ayumi, you saved me!

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:01.190
You grabbed my hand!

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:06.590
If I hadn't, I would never
have forgiven myself.

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:11.180
Ever since you showed up, I've had all these
emotions I've never experienced before...

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:19.290
welling up inside me! Anxiety,
confusion, envy, hatred...

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:25.710
I hate myself because of you!

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:30.050
Why are you crying?!

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:33.770
Because that's just too sad!

00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:36.580
Don't pity me! You're interfering
with my rehearsal!

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:37.850
Go away!

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:41.830
It's not pity! I've felt
the same way!

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:43.980
I felt just like you, Ayumi!

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:45.190
What are you talking about?

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:50.930
I've always felt inferior to you.

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:55.990
You don't say! Then,
that makes us even!

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:06.410
Now you know that you're my rival. I put my
life on the line to get the Scarlet Angel!

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:08.570
I won't let you have it!

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:14.230
I can't let you have it either,
no matter what!

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:21.110
I've come all this way for the Scarlet Angel.
I'm not going to lose it now, no matter what!

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:25.280
Same goes for me! It's been my
dream ever since I was a child!

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:30.550
You've been nothing but an eyesore
to me this whole time!

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:35.420
The way you act all inferior and your servile
manner of speaking makes me want to puke!

00:08:36.860 --> 00:08:40.060
I had nothing but
respect for you!

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:42.070
I thought you were a
wonderful person!

00:08:42.070 --> 00:08:43.150
And now this!

00:08:44.310 --> 00:08:46.990
That's just the picture you
constructed of me.

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:50.290
Without even bothering to
get to know the real me!

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:53.170
Well, you've always been so
calm and full of confidence,

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:55.650
and you've never talked
about your real feelings!

00:08:55.650 --> 00:08:58.330
No, <i>you're</i> the one who's
always skulking around...

00:08:58.330 --> 00:09:00.470
with your tail between your legs, putting
other people on pedestals!

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:02.860
I despise people like you!

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:07.600
Well, I despise arrogant
fools like you!

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:09.350
How am I arrogant?!

00:09:09.350 --> 00:09:12.680
You always surround yourself with an
entourage and behave like a queen!

00:09:12.680 --> 00:09:14.940
Can I help it if they
follow me around?!

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:18.280
I don't have a single
true friend!

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:21.600
Not that someone like you, who always has
the easy ride, would understand that feeling!

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:24.310
You've always got friends
around to help you out!

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:28.840
You don't know how much
I've envied you!

00:09:30.050 --> 00:09:32.630
I might have followers,
but I have no friends.

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:36.240
No matter how glamorous I may have
looked, I've always been alone.

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:39.630
You don't know how jealous
I've been of you.

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:41.580
Ayumi...

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:46.380
And that's why I hate you!

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:50.270
And I hate you!

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:51.660
Stop it!

00:09:51.660 --> 00:09:53.080
Coward!

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:54.900
You're the coward!

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:04.430
I should have let you fall!

00:10:04.430 --> 00:10:06.430
Well, you didn't!

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:09.430
You owe me your
life! Let go of me!

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:12.530
Yeah, you decided to save
me only at the last second!

00:10:13.610 --> 00:10:15.510
How dare you!

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:34.730
That hurt.

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:37.500
What are you going to do
if my face swells up?

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:39.270
What about me?

00:10:40.020 --> 00:10:42.940
I bit the inside of my mouth.

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:44.930
Serves you right.

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:46.180
You're mean.

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:50.050
You look awful.

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:51.680
You don't look any better.

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:01.200
You're not bad, you know.

00:11:02.270 --> 00:11:03.990
Right back at you, darling.

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:06.100
You're one to talk.

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:09.900
I think I might be the only person
who's ever seen your true side.

00:11:22.190 --> 00:11:23.300
Maya...

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:26.050
What is it, Ayumi?

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:28.560
Remember what I said?

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:31.860
You're my rival.

00:11:31.860 --> 00:11:35.000
I'm going to beat you.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:38.300
And then, I'll be the one who gets to play
the Scarlet Angel, fair and square.

00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:40.080
Ayumi...

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:43.500
I'm not going to lose this.

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:48.000
I will inherit the role from
Ms. Tsukikage.

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:51.020
Ayumi!

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:06.990
Did the Scarlet Angel
fly up into the sky?

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:10.980
I wonder how the Earth
looked from above?

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:21.860
The movements of nature are the
tides of the Scarlet Angel's soul.

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:34.860
The heart of the Scarlet
Angel controls nature.

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:41.400
It's not a human heart, but
the heart of a goddess.

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:46.400
What are you rehearsing
right now, Maya?

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:54.800
What kind of heart can cause
it to rain like this?

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:37.900
Two rainbows.

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:40.670
The sky and the pond.

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:46.430
The resonance in the Scarlet Angel's
heart becomes a voice,

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:51.680
becomes a word that shakes all nature
and stirs it into action.

00:13:56.770 --> 00:14:01.600
I don't understand why humans
fight each other.

00:14:02.060 --> 00:14:05.830
Why do they spill their own
blood and kill each other?

00:14:08.550 --> 00:14:12.940
This gentle sensation
feels so good.

00:14:13.730 --> 00:14:17.840
The relaxed air calms my body
all the way to its core.

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:24.740
I am the rainbow, the sunshine,
the whole forest.

00:14:30.740 --> 00:14:35.630
Two Scarlet Angels, two
Isshins, two directors.

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:40.430
When the three sets of rivals arrive, we shall
show everyone your Scarlet Angels.

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:45.910
When the suspension bridge has been repaired,
I will take you down to the Valley of the Plums.

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:52.110
And then, you will be the first to see
Maya's and Ayumi's Scarlet Angels.

00:14:52.110 --> 00:14:56.430
And after that, you will see
the real Scarlet Angel.

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:08.180
Watch where you tread!

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:13.990
Are you all right, sir?

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:15.230
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:18.740
I just need a breather.

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:21.460
What are you doing?

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:24.050
Put my father on my back.

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:26.220
Yes, sir.

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:31.980
I won't take no for an answer.

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:34.130
We can't be late on this one.

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:38.850
Mr. Masumi...

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:45.010
I'd like to welcome everyone to the
home of <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:15:45.230 --> 00:15:53.140
Since I abandoned the stage, <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>
has remained only in the hearts and memories...

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:56.310
of the people who saw
her decades ago.

00:15:56.310 --> 00:16:00.540
Much time has passed since then, but now
we have two talented young actresses...

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:03.350
to take up her mantle and
help her to be reborn.

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:10.270
I have yet to decide which one of them
will play the Scarlet Angel, but today,

00:16:10.270 --> 00:16:13.480
I would like you to observe the
progress they have made.

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:18.360
Afterwards, even though my stage fright
will be monumental because I will be
relying on ancient memories to perform,

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:22.480
I would like you all to watch
me play the Scarlet Angel.

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:55.560
"Who? Who is trying to wake me?"

00:16:58.050 --> 00:17:01.780
"Is it the spirit of the trees or the silence of evening..."

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:05.060
"No, this is the scent
of blood."

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:11.320
An angel.

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:23.160
"I can see two spirals crashing
against one another."

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:29.200
"One red, the other white; two tops
that will shake heaven and earth."

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:30.930
"They spin and repel
each other."

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:37.000
"They destroy everything in their wake and swell;
the two tops that continue to spin."

00:17:39.730 --> 00:17:43.930
"The humans cannot see me.
They don't even know I exist."

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:46.630
"Nor that every object has
life instilled inside it."

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:52.150
"Nor that the souls of every object spring
from the same root as the human soul."

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.930
Next up, we have
Maya Kitajima.

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:30.330
"Who? Who is trying to wake me?"

00:18:31.060 --> 00:18:35.630
"Is it the spirit of the trees or the silence of evening..."

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:39.480
"No, this is the scent
of blood."

00:18:42.210 --> 00:18:44.070
"They spin and spin."

00:18:44.070 --> 00:18:46.400
"They crash into each
other and repel."

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:53.470
"They destroy everything in their wake and swell;
the two tops that continue to spin even more fiercely...

00:18:53.470 --> 00:18:58.820
around the center of the two tops. Hate and
sadness spread their talons across the land."

00:18:58.820 --> 00:19:02.340
"One by one, the
orbs of life die."

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:29.330
It's a helix.

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:30.060
Huh?

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:33.770
The vibrations she's creating are turning into
sound and that sound is spreading outwards.

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:39.390
"This land houses the gods."

00:19:39.390 --> 00:19:41.180
"This is hallowed ground."

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:43.230
"This plum is my body."

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:50.630
"My power will ascend into the skies as a
helix and foster the creatures of the earth,

00:19:50.630 --> 00:19:53.350
the creatures of the water."

00:19:53.350 --> 00:19:56.700
"Everything that grows roots
or crawls on the earth;

00:19:56.700 --> 00:20:00.060
everything that flies,
walks or swims:

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:06.410
Grow quickly. Multiply
and be joyous."

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:12.030
"I shall make the flowers of life bloom
for a thousand scarlet years!"

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:20.580
Maya Kitajima has astonishing
stage presence as well!

00:20:20.580 --> 00:20:25.840
Yes, but Ayumi Himekawa has a sense
of grace that nobody can imitate.

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:30.660
You're up soon.

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:31.760
I know.

00:20:37.050 --> 00:20:38.260
My lady!

00:20:38.260 --> 00:20:42.080
Ichiren. You are the other
half of my soul.

00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:44.280
Now, we shall become one.

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:49.560
This will be my last depiction
of the Scarlet Angel!

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:16.300
Remember that each experience
is directly tied to acting.

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:20.080
You have a thousand
masks, Maya.

00:21:20.080 --> 00:21:21.860
A thousand masks?

00:21:21.860 --> 00:21:25.810
Even if nobody else understands
that, I do.

00:21:25.810 --> 00:21:29.430
You're the girl with
a thousand masks.

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:32.250
A thousand masks.

00:21:35.240 --> 00:21:40.310
Chigusa Tsukikage had broken the
seal of the Scarlet Angel herself.

00:21:40.310 --> 00:21:45.750
The forbidden love between a man and
an angel is about to be revived...

00:21:45.750 --> 00:21:48.090
in the Valley of the Plums.

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:56.680
Hello hello

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:56.680
Hello, hello.

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:15.280
Fukanou dato iwarenagara
tobitatte

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:15.280
Even though they say it's
impossible, I fly off.

00:22:15.280 --> 00:22:25.160
Kanaeta yume mo koboreochita
yume mo aru

00:22:15.280 --> 00:22:25.160
There are dreams that come true,
and dreams that crumble away.

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:36.830
Soredemo isshoukenmei ikiru
kazu dake hoshi ga fueru

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:36.830
But even then, for every person trying hard
to live their life, a new star is born.

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:49.240
Kyou mo mata hitotsu
umareru hoshi miagete

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:49.240
Today, I look up again, at
another newly born star.

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:50.570
And I say,

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:50.570
And I say,

00:22:50.570 --> 00:22:53.890
Hello hello another star

00:22:50.570 --> 00:22:53.890
Hello, hello another star.

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:57.030
If I wish anything
will change

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:57.030
If I wish anything will change.

00:22:57.030 --> 00:23:02.770
Ai wo daite norikonda
shatoru

00:22:57.030 --> 00:23:02.770
I've boarded the shuttle
with my love.

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:09.120
Daremo ga hitori no
uchuuhikoushi dayo

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:09.120
Every single person
is an astronaut.

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:14.190
Negau yume
kara yume e

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:14.190
From fulfilled dream to dream,

00:23:14.190 --> 00:23:21.470
Dokomademo
yukeru one life

00:23:14.190 --> 00:23:21.470
I can go anywhere... One life.

00:23:22.180 --> 00:23:25.350
The angel that met the
other half of her soul.

00:23:26.080 --> 00:23:28.350
My darling.

00:23:28.660 --> 00:23:36.190
"Your eyes, with which you watch me;
your arms, with which you hold me...

00:23:36.190 --> 00:23:38.580
you and I together
share one soul."

00:23:39.130 --> 00:23:42.690
"Now that we've met, how
can we live apart?"

00:23:43.490 --> 00:23:49.060
The heat and tension in my heart...
is this the love of the angel?

00:23:45.950 --> 00:23:51.500
Episode 51 - The
Scarlet Angel

00:23:49.060 --> 00:23:50.610
Or is it...
